 "text": "Tor is a mound of the land of Britain. It is a pyramidal, pointed hill near Glastonbury. The hill is a way into the Otherworld. It holds the king of the fairyland at its base, a lord named Gwynn. When St Collen cast holy water on the site, the whole sight dissolved. A chapel and two wells also mark the place.",
